      <activity id="76325e86-7078-549b-8543-e30dec34f2df" activityNameId="f100eea8-b2cc-546c-86dc-3cc411c18404" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hard coal, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hard coal, at regional storage
Average transport distance specific for the country has been used. Dust from transport and load/unload operations is included. Average coal losses are considered. Average emissions to water due to leaching from coal heaps at storage is estimated from the literature.;
UUID: a6ca5778-fb64-3170-9f49-90fdaad76913
This module includes the transport of the coal to harbours and storage.
Location: Generic values applicable worldwide.
Technology: Not specified
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a6ca5778-fb64-3170-9f49-90fdaad76913.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
